    "message": "Merge feature/rust-port into rust/b2-tick-validation\n\nBoth lanes changed the native registrations and the kernel tests; the reservation\nID check keeps the per-tick tail check, which covers what the type scan saved.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
